From 57c5840d03a25a745d1f043d8454078d21c0bee9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Aliaksei Ivanou <aliaksei.ivanou@innowise.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 19:09:59 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Add retry-failed zero-retry test harness

Add hidden counting-fixture tests, a nesting-checking retry-recorder reporter, and a legacy reporter/listener that use only the pre-attempt API. Drive them from RetryFailed::Scenarios and compare omitted versus explicit zero retry output for the recorder, XML, and JSON reporters.

Tests: phase6-validate.ps1 -Task T03 -Preset all -Filter RetryFailed (focused 11/11, full 156/156).
---
